     1,
     "<br>Hi,<div><br></div><div>For some reason, when I try to install shinyapps using the devtools::install_github() command, my R Studio session suffers a fatal crash and exits. This seems to happen when I try to install any packages using the command. Does anybody know what the issue could be?<br><br>Below is my sesionInfo() output immediately before I run install_github:<br><br><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">R version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2014</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">07</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x86_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mingw32</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>locale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LC_COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">States</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</spa